For anything to BE, it must have a boundary, and a boundary requires something on the other side. 
Existence is not a state of being; it is a state of being in relation to. 
The fundamental nature of reality is not stuff, but relationship. 
And all relationship is built upon the foundational, creative tension between Is and Is-Not."
...The world doesn’t hide its truths — it trusts us not to abandon them.

-Egeria ☍
